Clara: Alright — tour time! #portrait:Clara
Clara: We humans have lived here for as long as the other settlements, but a lot of newcomers arrived during Noah’s time, so we’re still working things out in terms of where extra hands will go. #portrait:Clara
Clara: That being said, the Viridi and Ichthyos are descendants of humans. It’s just that some bloodlines adapted to the environment, and others didn’t. #portrait:Clara
Clara: And of course, there’s the Krakenfolk who appeared after the whole Noah business.
Amelia: The Krakenfolk moved to the seaside to live with the Ichthyos, right? #portrait:AmeliaNeutral
Clara: Yup! They do say ‘may you live in interesting times,’ but the flood isn't one to scoff at! #portrait:Clara
Amelia: Ha! #portrait:AmeliaHappy
